! Optional NO tie switches for the 906-bus European LV test system.
! Pairs are distinct network leaves with long graph distance (different branches of the radial tree).
! Switch=y + enabled=n => open at base case, cataloged by FeederFlow.
! Impedance matches 240_bus circuit-breaker style (low R/X, no shunt).
!
! Remove or comment the Redirect in 906bus_Master.dss to drop all ties at once.

New Line.Tie01  Phases=3  Bus1=906  Bus2=103  Switch=y  enabled=n  r1=0.001  r0=0.001  x1=0.001  x0=0.001  c1=0  c0=0
